{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ChS7 is a passenger, two-section, eight-axle electric locomotive operating on 3 kV DC. It was produced between 1983 and 1998 at the \u0160koda factory in Plze\u0148 for the railways of the Soviet Union (and later Russia and Ukraine). A total of 321 locomotives were built, most of which remain in regular operation as of 2024.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is one of the most powerful DC passenger electric locomotives used in the former USSR.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614840?t=1744917876","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614840/dcc1a87ddfe7ec2d404004b543e6f3e146f6242f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744917876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614840/3e1e0d29587f5a70648f62293f2d9f9ca760b916/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744917876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614840/3e1e0d29587f5a70648f62293f2d9f9ca760b916/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744917876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ChS7 is a passenger, two-section, eight-axle electric locomotive operating on 3 kV DC. It was produced between 1983 and 1998 at the \u0160koda factory in Plze\u0148 for the railways of the Soviet Union (and later Russia and Ukraine). A total of 321 locomotives were built, most of which remain in regular operation as of 2024.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is one of the most powerful DC passenger electric locomotives used in the former USSR.</p>","developers":["ZDSimulator Team"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3381120","name":"ZDSimulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https